# Build artefacts and caches
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.nx
**/.nx
tmp
**/tmp
coverage
**/coverage
test-output
**/test-output

# Logs
*.log
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*

# Env / secrets — never bake into image
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

